    "name": "Fresh Frozen Elderberries",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Raw or unripe elderberries contain natural compounds that can cause stomach upset and must always be cooked or thoroughly dried/heated before consumption.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong class=\"lexical-text-editor--bold\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Flavor Profile:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"> Deep, earthy, sweet, and tart when cooked or steeped.</span></p><ul class=\"lexical-text-editor--list-ul\"><li value=\"1\"><b><strong class=\"lexical-text-editor--bold\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Key Uses:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"> Perfect for simmering homemade immune syrups, blending into herbal teas, or baking into jams, jellies, and pies.</span></li><li value=\"2\"><b><strong class=\"lexical-text-editor--bold\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Nutritional Benefits:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"> Loaded with natural anthocyanins and powerful antioxidants that support year-round immune wellness. </span></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">#3 bag of 2026 fresh frozen, cleaned, destemed, organic elderberries.</span></p>",
